<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing said cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Boeing said cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney has cut its rating for Boeing Co to neutral from outperform, a source at the brokerage said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the airplane maker closed Monday at 95-1/4.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
